  "answer": 0,
  "explain": {
   "en": "Τηλέφωνο is stressed on the third syllable from the end (τη-λέ-φω-νο), so before σας it takes a second accent on its last syllable: το τηλέφωνό σας. The stress itself never moves: τηλεφώνο is wrong.",
   "tr": "Τηλέφωνο sondan üçüncü hecede vurgulu (τη-λέ-φω-νο); σας gelince son hecesi ikinci bir vurgu alır: το τηλέφωνό σας. Asıl vurgu yerinden oynamaz: τηλεφώνο yanlış."
  },
  "source": {
